NOTICE

This project includes code patterns and implementation approaches from the
following open-source projects:

1. remotely-save
   Copyright (c) 2021-present fyears
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   https://github.com/remotely-save/remotely-save

   Specific patterns referenced:
   - OneDrive OAuth authentication and token exchange
   - Chunked upload implementation for large files
   - Token storage obfuscation approach
   - PKCE code generation patterns

2. Home Assistant OneDrive Integration
   Copyright (c) Home Assistant
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/onedrive

   Specific patterns referenced:
   - Error decorator pattern for sync errors
   - Dynamic chunk sizing calculation
   - Coordinator pattern for sync orchestration

We are grateful to these projects for their excellent open-source work.

